	(text_box "VBAT -> 3.3v switching-mode boost regulator. VBAT may fall below 0.9v and continue working down to ~0.4v, but if it's < ~0.9v when inserted or switched on it won't power up VOUT. Though alkaline cells have almost no power left below ~1v anyways."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 96.52 22.86 0)
